        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come Out, Cat</strong> is<br>a short and simple adventure game where you call out to a cat who's hiding away,<br>hoping to coax them back into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930300/extras/1b05d1b15fd09f2fafb273ad70a07d9e.webp?t=1774073061\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930300/extras/1b05d1b15fd09f2fafb273ad70a07d9e.poster.avif?t=1774073061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐈️ How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>two word cards</strong> — one action, one subject.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them to call out to the cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to how the cat reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use those reactions to figure out the right words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find the right phrase, the cat will come out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Streaming / Videos / Fan Works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream, record, or create fan content —<br>as long as it’s within the bounds of common sense!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come Out, Cat</strong> is<br>a short and simple adventure game where you call out to a cat who's hiding away,<br>hoping to coax them back into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930300/extras/1b05d1b15fd09f2fafb273ad70a07d9e.webp?t=1774073061\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930300/extras/1b05d1b15fd09f2fafb273ad70a07d9e.poster.avif?t=1774073061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=700 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐈️ How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>two word cards</strong> — one action, one subject.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them to call out to the cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to how the cat reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use those reactions to figure out the right words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find the right phrase, the cat will come out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🖥️ Streaming / Videos / Fan Works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream, record, or create fan content —<br>as long as it’s within the bounds of common sense!</p>",
